    "schemaVersion": "1.0",
    "terrainName": "berlin",
    "description": "What: on berlin a BLUE battalion HQ (a physical unit, no body: CompanyAttack on (700,500)) over THREE stochastic companies (90 men each, from the TKB composite) attacks a RED battalion HQ (CompanyDefend on (700,500), facing west) over three stochastic companies, the two lines 600 m apart. Judge: (1) every company is ordered by KIND - Red's three run the generic Defend, the assault company the generic Attack; no stochastic company is given a physical play; (2) the census agrees with the slot tables: a HoldArea objective round each HQ's three companies (300 m) needs 270 men = 3 x 90 slot-table men present, and reads Achieved; (3) each company's SITREP colour agrees with its slot table (the assault company wiped out reads Black at its HQ; each Red company's colour lands in the band its slot table gives - Green under 10 of 90 down, Amber under 28); (4) the fight runs to an end: the assault company is lost (PROGRESS TaskFailed at its HQ) and the others hold. Fail: a physical play on a stochastic unit, a census that does not equal the slot tables, a colour that disagrees with them, or no end. Check: scripts/scenario-regression.sh agg-battalion-fight"
  },
